  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EC-law for civil servants</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU/EG-r&#xe4;tt statstj&#xe4;nstem.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja Estlands integrationsprocess genom att ge de statstj&#xe4;nstem&#xe4;n som direkt arbetar med detta grund- l&#xe4;ggande kunskap om och f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;else f&#xf6;r EG-r&#xe4;tten och relaterade fr&#xe5;gorUtbildningen best&#xe5;r av en serie av en-veckas seminarier under en termin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide training to a pre-selected target group of 50Estonian civil servants on the foundations of European Union law to assist these persons in understanding the process of harmonisation of laws. The training consists of a series of one-week seminars during one semester.</narrative>
